<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Sept 12-18:</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.06</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 59.70</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.39</p>
<p>   Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.47</p>
<p>   Cocoa butter...............................$152.08</p>
<p>   Residual butter............................$114.06</p>
<p>   Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>   Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 80.63</p>
<p>   Cocoa cake.................................$ 20.49</p>
<p>   Residual natural cake......................$  2.05</p>
<p>   Cocoa powder...............................$ 22.74</p>
</text>
